@C1 "**Milestone**" has the meaning given in Section 9.1, and "**Milestone Date**" means the applicable date by which a Milestone must be achieved, as extended pursuant to Section 9.3.
@C1 "**New Lease**" has the meaning given in Section 10.5.
@C1 "**Percentage Rent**" has the meaning given in Section 5.1.
@C1 "**Permitted Exceptions**" means the matters described on **Exhibit B** attached hereto, and such other matters as Tenant may approve in writing in its sole discretion.
@C1 "**Person**" means any individual, corporation, limited liability company, partnership, trust, association, governmental authority, or other entity.
@C1 "**Project**" means the mixed-use development to be constructed on the Premises substantially in accordance with the Project Program attached as **Exhibit E**, including the Residential Tower, the Office Building, ground-floor retail space, accessory parking, and the Public Open Space.
