@H2 17.3 Exceptions to Mediation
@P The mediation requirement of Section 17.2 shall not apply to (a) any action seeking injunctive relief, specific performance, or the appointment of a receiver; (b) any exercise of a right or remedy by a Leasehold Mortgagee, or any action to foreclose or otherwise enforce a Leasehold Mortgage; (c) any action to collect Rent or to recover possession following a termination; (d) any exercise of the Reverter Right, or any challenge thereto; or (e) any determination expressly required to be made by an appraiser or accountant under this Lease.
