@H2 18.1 Notices
@P All notices, demands, consents, and other communications under this Lease shall be in writing and shall be deemed duly given (a) upon personal delivery, (b) one (1) Business Day after deposit with a nationally recognized overnight courier, (c) three (3) Business Days after deposit in the United States mail, certified or registered, return receipt requested, postage prepaid, or (d) upon transmission by electronic mail, provided that a copy is also sent by one of the foregoing methods within two (2) Business Days, addressed as follows (or to such other address as a party may designate by notice):
