@P Nothing in this Lease shall be construed to require Landlord to take any action prohibited by its enabling legislation or by Applicable Law, or to pledge the full faith and credit of the City of Port Calloway. Landlord acknowledges, however, that the obligations it has undertaken in this Lease are valid and binding obligations payable from its general funds to the extent provided herein, and that it has obtained all approvals required to undertake them.
