@ROW 10~Rent Commencement is triggered by a certificate of occupancy for "any portion of the Project"~A single retail suite or model unit would start $2.85M a year of Base Rent~9
@ROW 11~Construction loan matures before Phase 2 is complete; completion guaranty is impossible as written~Loan maturity (Oct 2029, or Oct 2030 extended) precedes Milestone 4 (Oct 2032); the guaranty runs to the Initial Maturity Date~10
